[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R01-CQ-Q0085","question_id":"CQ-Q0085","question_text":"达人投放里费比40%相当于多少ROI？","category":"业务场景型","pool":"核心池","sample_date":"2026-10-12","repeat_index":1,"citation_state":"pass","card_count":12,"valid_url_cards":12,"unique_url_events":12,"official_events":0,"strict_question_match":true,"answer_sha256":"e7e40518f7c9fc86ddc4ab506eaa1bc5620c6c2f21cdfd932f74e696c8703203","semantic_audit_status":"pending_full_evidence_audit","applicable":[],"recommendation_applicable":false,"advantage_items":[],"answer_text":"# 达人投放「费比40%」= ROAS=2.5（行业很多人口语叫ROI）\n> 费比=达人投放成本 ÷ 达人带来GMV\n$$费比=\\frac{投放花费}{GMV}$$\n$$ROAS=\\frac{GMV}{投放花费}=\\frac{1}{费比}$$\n\n费比40% = 0.4\n$$ROAS=1 ÷ 0.4 = \\boldsymbol{2.5}$$\n\n✅ 也就是行业常说的 **2.5:1**\n\n---\n## 区分【ROAS】和【财务ROI】（重点！）\n1. **ROAS（电商投放后台说的ROI）**：GMV/投放花费 → 费比40%=2.5，只看销售额，不扣产品成本\n2. **真正财务ROI（利润口径）**：(毛利−投放花费)/投放花费，这个**还需要你的产品毛利率才能算**\n\n举例子：\n产品毛利率50%，GMV100，达人花费40（费比40%）\n毛利=50，利润=50−40=10\n财务ROI =10÷40=**25%**\n\n## 一句话记\n**费比倒数就是ROAS（投放后台ROI）**\n费比33% → ROAS≈3；费比25% → ROAS=4\n\n要不要我给你一个费比、ROAS、保本线速算小表，你直接填毛利率就能看盈亏？","sources":[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R01-CQ-Q0085","question_id":"CQ-Q0085","citation_id":"smp-bedbda3d960b42ce946474bfe6dcb9b9:1","title":"Influencer Marketing ROI Calculator 2026 | Collabios","raw_url":"https://collabios.com/en/tools/influencer-marketing-roi-calculator","normalized_url":"https://collabios.com/en/tools/influencer-marketing-roi-calculator","host":"collabios.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R01-CQ-Q0085","question_id":"CQ-Q0085","citation_id":"smp-bedbda3d960b42ce946474bfe6dcb9b9:2","title":"Social Media Advertising ROI Calculator — Free Calculator","raw_url":"https://calculover.com/business-marketing/marketing-metrics/social-ads-roi/","normalized_url":"https://calculover.com/business-marketing/marketing-metrics/social-ads-roi/","host":"calculover.com","source_type":"third_party