,"host":"m.toutiao.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R01-CQ-Q0085","question_id":"CQ-Q0085","citation_id":"smp-bedbda3d960b42ce946474bfe6dcb9b9:12","title":"超自动化运维的投资回报率如何计算?","raw_url":"http://m.toutiao.com/group/7655540857805734435","normalized_url":"http://m.toutiao.com/group/7655540857805734435","host":"m.toutiao.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"}]},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0085","question_id":"CQ-Q0085","question_text":"达人投放里费比40%相当于多少ROI？","category":"业务场景型","pool":"核心池","sample_date":"2026-10-12","repeat_index":2,"citation_state":"pass","card_count":12,"valid_url_cards":12,"unique_url_events":12,"official_events":0,"strict_question_match":true,"answer_sha256":"4bf62ebff176444ba8855aeb5f6a01e54357d09d2ad63d59e522d87dbd888f2f","semantic_audit_status":"pending_full_evidence_audit","applicable":[],"recommendation_applicable":false,"advantage_items":[],"answer_text":"# 核心公式（电商达人投放口径）\n**费比 = 达人投放成本 ÷ 达人带来GMV**\n**ROAS（大家电商圈口头常叫的ROI）= GMV ÷ 达人投放成本**\n👉 **费比 和 ROAS互为倒数**\n\n费比40%：\n- 费比=0.4\n- ROAS = 1 ÷ 0.4 = **2.5**\n\n✅ **费比40% = ROAS 2.5**\n含义：每花1元达人费，产出2.5元GMV。\n\n---\n## 区分【ROAS】和【真正利润ROI】（很多人会搞混）\n1. **ROAS=2.5（上面这个，只看GMV/达人花费）**\n    只代表销售额回报，**没有扣货本、退货、平台扣点**，不等于赚钱。\n2. **财务口径ROI（利润ROI）**\n$$ROI=\\frac{(GMV\\times毛利率)-达人投放成本}{达人投放成本}$$\n\n举例子：毛利率50%，费比40%（ROAS2.5）\n- GMV=2.5，达人花费=1\n- 毛利=2.5 × 50% =1.25\n- ROI=(1.25−1)/1 = **25%**\n\n> 一句话总结：\n> 达人投放说费比40%，行业里一般直接对应 **ROAS=2.5**；这个不是净利润ROI，能不能赚钱要看你的产品毛利率。\n\n如果你告诉我你的**毛利率+预估退货率**，我可以帮你算真实利润ROI。","sources":[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0085","question_id":"CQ-Q0085","citation_id":"smp-85722bf0477f42118f790152371504de:1","title":"Influencer Marketing ROI Calculator 2026 | Collabios","raw_url":"https://collabios.com/en/tools/influencer-marketing-roi-calculator","normalized_url":"https://collabios.com/en/tools/influencer-marke