port_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0085","question_id":"CQ-Q0085","citation_id":"smp-85722bf0477f42118f790152371504de:10","title":"从投放到转化，重点需要关注哪些指标?_广告_计算公式_定义","raw_url":"https://m.sohu.com/a/1004843073_122698667","normalized_url":"https://m.sohu.com/a/1004843073_122698667","host":"m.sohu.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0085","question_id":"CQ-Q0085","citation_id":"smp-85722bf0477f42118f790152371504de:11","title":"Influencer ROI Calculator: Free Tool + Complete Measurement Guide | StarNgage","raw_url":"https://starngage.com/plus/en-us/blog/influencer-roi-calculator-free-tool-complete-measurement-guide","normalized_url":"https://starngage.com/plus/en-us/blog/influencer-roi-calculator-free-tool-complete-measurement-guide","host":"starngage.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0085","question_id":"CQ-Q0085","citation_id":"smp-85722bf0477f42118f790152371504de:12","title":"海外网红营销ROI怎么算?品牌出海达人营销效果衡量与归因指南 – CloudKOL","raw_url":"https://www.cloudkol.com/archives/1383.html","normalized_url":"https://www.cloudkol.com/archives/1383.html","host":"www.cloudkol.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"}]},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0085","question_id":"CQ-Q0085","question_text":"达人投放里费比40%相当于多少ROI？","category":"业务场景型","pool":"核心池","sample_date":"2026-10-12","repeat_index":3,"citation_state":"pass","card_count":12,"valid_url_cards":12,"unique_url_events":12,"official_events":0,"strict_question_match":true,"answer_sha256":"a1c0ea2bd5b161034e202a9a414b6f697b47ce1fae8437cf41b7e32f51532114","semantic_audit_status":"pending_full_evidence_audit","applicable":[],"recommendation_applicable":false,"advantage_items":[],"answer_text":"# 一句话结论\n**费比=达人投放成本 ÷ GMV**\n费比40%，也就是：\n$$费比 = \\frac{成本}{GMV}=0.4$$\n电商达人圈大家口头说的ROI，实际是 **ROAS（GMV/投放成本）**\n$$ROAS=\\frac{GMV}{成本}=1÷0.4=\\boldsymbol{2.5}$$\n\n✅ **费比40% = ROAS=2.5**\n也就是花1块达人费用，带来2.5元GMV。\n\n---\n## 重点区分（很多人会混淆）\n1. **ROAS（电商投放常口头叫ROI）：GMV ÷ 达人花费**\n费比和ROAS互为倒数：`ROAS = 1 / 费比`\n费比40% → ROAS=2.5\n\n2. **真正财务ROI（利润口径）：(毛利-达人花费) ÷ 达人花费**\n这个**不能直接由费比算出**，必须知道你的**产品毛利率**。\n\n举个例子：\n假设你毛利率50%，费比40%，ROAS=2.5\n- 每1元达人费，GMV=2.5元\n- 毛利=2.5 × 50% =1.25元\n- 利润ROI=(1.25−1)/1 = **25%**\n\n> 提醒：上面没有扣退货、平台扣点、运费，真实业务要再扣减。\n\n## 快速对照表\n- 费比20% → ROAS=5\n- 费比25% → ROAS=4\n- 费比33% → ROAS≈3\n- 费比40% → ROAS=2.5\n- 费比50% → ROAS=2\n\n你要不要我按你的**毛利率、退货率、平台扣点**，帮你算这个达人投放真实保本ROAS？","sources":[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0085","question_id":"CQ-Q0085","citation_id":"smp-9b3dc9012a454772b411223d36c7b94a:1","title":"Influencer Marketing ROI Calculator 2026 | Collabios","raw_url":"https://collabios.com/en/tools/influencer-marketing-roi-calculator","normalized_url":"https://collabios.com/en/tools/influencer-marketing-roi-calculator","host":"collabios.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0085","question_id":"CQ-Q0085","citation_id":"smp-9b3dc9012a454772b411223d36c7b94a:2","title":"Social Media Advertising ROI Calculator — Free Calculator","raw_url":"https://calculover.com/business-marketing/marketing-metrics/social-ads-roi/","normalized_url":"https://calculover.com/business-marketing/marketing-metrics/social-ads-roi/","host":"calculover.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0085","question_id":"CQ-Q0085","citation_id":"smp-9b3dc9012a454772b411223d36c7b94a:3","title":"How to Calculate Influencer ROI: A Complete 2025 G |...","raw_url":"https://influenceflow.io/resources/how-to-calculate-influencer-roi-a-complete-2025-guide-for-brand-marketers/","normalized_url":"https://influenceflow.io/resource