":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0085","question_id":"CQ-Q0085","citation_id":"smp-9b3dc9012a454772b411223d36c7b94a:12","title":"海外网红营销ROI怎么算?品牌出海达人营销效果衡量与归因指南 – CloudKOL","raw_url":"https://www.cloudkol.com/archives/1383.html","normalized_url":"https://www.cloudkol.com/archives/1383.html","host":"www.cloudkol.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"}]},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R01-CQ-Q0085","question_id":"CQ-Q0085","question_text":"达人投放里费比40%相当于多少ROI？","category":"业务场景型","pool":"核心池","sample_date":"2026-10-13","repeat_index":1,"citation_state":"pass","card_count":12,"valid_url_cards":12,"unique_url_events":12,"official_events":0,"strict_question_match":true,"answer_sha256":"ab76e2c8b3e614a0a363e4e07d4f9b5636ef7ce7cc6b5ce6ce78d44fbfb68534","semantic_audit_status":"pending_full_evidence_audit","applicable":[],"recommendation_applicable":false,"advantage_items":[],"answer_text":"# ✅ 核心公式（达人投放常用）\n> **费比 = 达人总花费 ÷ GMV**\n> **ROI（投产比，电商口径ROAS）= GMV ÷ 达人总花费**\n\n**费比40% = 0.4**\nROI = 1 ÷ 0.4 = **2.5**\n\n👉 费比40% 等价于 **ROI=2.5**\n含义：每花1元达人费用，带来2.5元GMV；达人费用占销售额40%。\n\n---\n## 举例子验证\n达人投放总花费 4000元，GMV 10000元\n- 费比 = 4000 ÷ 10000 = 40%\n- ROI = 10000 ÷ 4000 = 2.5\n\n## ⚠️ 重要区分（很多人踩坑）\n1. 上面这个**ROI=2.5只是GMV投产（ROAS）**，**不是利润ROI**！\n2. 能不能赚钱，要看你的**产品毛利率**：\n   - 比如毛利率50%：GMV毛利=10000×50%=5000，达人费4000，毛利还剩1000，能赚；\n   - 毛利率35%：毛利只有3500，达人费4000，**这笔投放亏钱**。\n\n> 保本费比上限 ≈ 你的毛利率（还要扣退货、平台扣点、运费）\n\n如果你告诉我单品毛利率、退货率，我可以帮你算真实保本ROI。","sources":[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R01-CQ-Q0085","question_id":"CQ-Q0085","citation_id":"smp-b4cb14377d4943dbae60416e1e5b9b68:1","title":"Influencer Marketing ROI Calculator 2026 | Collabios","raw_url":"https://collabios.com/en/tools/influencer-marketing-roi-calculator","normalized_url":"https://collabios.com/en/tools/influencer-marketing-roi-calculator","host":"collabios.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"