9b68:10","title":"#带货达人 #短视频带货 #电商带货 #新手带货 #保本roi计算方法","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7671185449758569701","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7671185449758569701","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R01-CQ-Q0085","question_id":"CQ-Q0085","citation_id":"smp-b4cb14377d4943dbae60416e1e5b9b68:11","title":"电商ROI投流计算器(商家版+达人版)- 免费在线计算保本ROI | 吴用大闲人","raw_url":"https://www.wuyong2025.cloud/calculator.html","normalized_url":"https://www.wuyong2025.cloud/calculator.html","host":"www.wuyong2025.cloud","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R01-CQ-Q0085","question_id":"CQ-Q0085","citation_id":"smp-b4cb14377d4943dbae60416e1e5b9b68:12","title":"电商roi怎么算?2026最新两种口径与三个公式详解 - 数分大白兔 - 企业博客","raw_url":"https://www.cnblogs.com/ruanjian-an-jiu-shi/articles/23227619","normalized_url":"https://www.cnblogs.com/ruanjian-an-jiu-shi/articles/23227619","host":"www.cnblogs.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"}]},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0085","question_id":"CQ-Q0085","question_text":"达人投放里费比40%相当于多少ROI？","category":"业务场景型","pool":"核心池","sample_date":"2026-10-13","repeat_index":2,"citation_state":"pass","card_count":12,"valid_url_cards":12,"unique_url_events":12,"official_events":0,"strict_question_match":true,"answer_sha256":"f675716eb56dd8c4e5a8a0de97db78f6e649000c4cd55ed94693ce866ceb1511","semantic_audit_status":"pending_full_evidence_audit","applicable":[],"recommendation_applicable":false,"advantage_items":[],"answer_text":"# 达人投放「费比40%」\n> 费比=达人投放成本 ÷ 达人带来GMV = 40%\n> 行业里大家口头说的ROI，大多其实是 **ROAS（GMV/投放消耗）**\n\n公式：\n**ROAS = 1 ÷ 费比**\n\n费比40%：\nROAS = 1 ÷ 0.4 = **2.5**\n\n✅ 也就是：**费比40% = ROAS 2.5**\n意思：每花1元达人费，带来2.5元GMV，达人成本占GMV的40%。\n\n---\n## 区分【ROAS】和真正财务【ROI】\n- ROAS（投放后台常叫ROI，带货圈口头ROI）：GMV/投放花费，上面2.5就是这个\n- 财务ROI（利润口径）：**(毛利-达人投放费) ÷ 达人投放费**\n\n举例：假设产品毛利率50%\n- GMV2.5，毛利=2.5×0.5=1.25\n- 达人投放花费=1\n- 财务ROI=(1.25−1)/1 = **25%**\n\n> 重点提醒：\n> 费比40%只代表达人成本占GMV40%，**能不能赚钱要看你的产品毛利率**：\n> 保本条件：毛利率＞费比；毛利率刚好40%时，这笔达人投放毛利打平，不赚不亏。\n\n要不要我给你一个速算小表：费比 ↔ ROAS对照，你直接复制到表格用？","sources":[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0085","question_id":"CQ-Q0085","citation_id":"smp-a040ab80fb694e18a7b7b44802156222:1","title":"Influencer Marketing ROI Calculator 2026 | Collabios","raw_url":"https://collabios.com/en/tools/influencer-marketing-roi-calculator","normalized_url":"https://collabios.com/en/tools/influencer-marketing-roi-calculator","host":"collabios.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0085","question_id":"CQ-Q0085","citation_id":"smp-a040ab80fb694e18a7b7b44802156222:2","title":"Social Media Advertising ROI Calculator — Free Calculator","raw_url":"https://calculover.com/business-marketing/marketing-metrics/social-ads-roi/","normalized_url":"https://calculover.com/business-marketing/marketing-metrics/social-ads-roi/","host":"calculover.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0085","question_id":"CQ-Q0085","citation_id":"smp-a040ab80fb694e18a7b7b44802156222:3","title":"How to Calculate Influencer ROI: A Complete 2025 G |...","raw_url":"https://influenceflow.io/resources/how-to-calculate-influencer-roi-a-complete-2025-guide-for-brand-marketers/","normalized_url":"https://influenceflow.io/resources/how-to-calculate-influencer-roi-a-complete-2025-guide-for-brand-marketers/","host":"influenceflow.io","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0085","question_id":"CQ-Q0085","citation_id":"smp-a040ab80fb694e18a7b7b44802156222:4","title":"ROI Calculation Methodology for Influe