0,"strict_question_match":true,"answer_sha256":"cf2d39d687f4f6dae2ed4eb15a7348dac07adfdffaba3ba1f022662957a2da23","semantic_audit_status":"pending_full_evidence_audit","applicable":[],"recommendation_applicable":false,"advantage_items":[],"answer_text":"# ✅ 达人投放「费比40%」= **ROI（投产比）2.5**\n> 电商达播通用口径：\n> **费比 = 达人总费用 ÷ GMV**\n> **ROI(投产) = GMV ÷ 达人总费用**\n\n公式互推：\n费比=40% = 0.4\nROI = 1 ÷ 费比 = 1 ÷ 0.4 = **2.5**\n\n举例：\nGMV 10000元，达人总花费（坑位费+佣金合计）4000元\n费比=4000/10000=40%\nROI=10000/4000=2.5\n\n---\n## ⚠️ 重要区分\n1. **这个ROI只代表达人费用占比，≠是否赚钱**\n费比40%意思：每卖出100元GMV，给达人合计花40元。\n能不能盈利，要看你的**毛利率是否＞40%**，还要扣退货、平台扣点、物流成本。\n- 毛利率＞40%：这笔达人投放才有可能盈利\n- 毛利率＜40%：哪怕费比稳定40%，依然亏钱\n\n2. 费比是【坑位费+佣金合并费比】\n如果分开看：坑位费固定+佣金浮动，那是动态费比，不能直接套这个简单公式。\n\n需要我帮你按你的**毛利率、退货率**，算真实保本费比和保本ROI吗？","sources":[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0085","question_id":"CQ-Q0085","citation_id":"smp-29f0b62e893c43efbbece4268f648dc7:1","title":"Influencer Marketing ROI Calculator 2026 | Collabios","raw_url":"https://collabios.com/en/tools/influencer-marketing-roi-calculator","normalized_url":"https://collabios.com/en/tools/influencer-marketing-roi-calculator","host":"collabios.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0085","question_id":"CQ-Q0085","citation_id":"smp-29f0b62e893c43efbbece4268f648dc7:2","title":"Social Media Advertising ROI Calculator — Free Calculator","raw_url":"https://calculover.com/business-marketing/marketing-metrics/social-ads-roi/","normalized_url":"https://calculover.com/business-marketing/marketing-metrics/social-ads-roi/","host":"calculover.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0085","question_id":"CQ-Q0085","citation_id":"smp-29f0b62e893c43efbbece4268f648dc7:3","title":"How to Calculate Influencer ROI: A Complete 2025 G |...","raw_url":"https://influenceflow.io/resources/how-to-calculate-influen